{"tool":"medusa.admin_post","args":{"path":"/admin/research/artifacts","body":{"record_type":"report","scope_id":"rscope_colander_es","save_key":"market-research-colander-es-2026-09-02-retained-v1","report_kind":"market_research","schema_revision":"market_research/1","template_revision":"market_research@1","skill_revision":"intgral-research/market@2","runbook_revision":"intgral-research@4","upstream_evidence_ids":["rart_amz_col_01_aug","rart_amz_col_01","rart_amz_col_02","rart_amz_col_04"],"coverage":{"status":"partial","gaps":["no review text collected","no research-market-measurement/1 record retained","no comparable trend series (only two dated points for B0FAKE0C01)","only 3 listings retained; no search-interest data","category-level sales and market size unknown"]},"markdown":"# 西班牙站折叠硅胶沥水篮 市场研究（仅用已保存证据，未新采集）\n\n**结论：explore（有条件，小范围核验）。** 需求证据是方向性的，不是测量值。\n\n## 证据\n- [B0FAKE0C01](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C01) 2026-09-02：11.99 EUR，评分 4.4（812），“Más de 200”→ 下限 200；2026-08-20：13.99 EUR，评分 4.4（776），下限 100。两个日期点，不是趋势。\n- [B0FAKE0C02](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C02) 2026-09-02：14.50 EUR（划线价 17.90），评分 4.1（2304），“Más de 500”→ 下限 500。\n- [B0FAKE0C04](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C04) 2026-09-02：硬塑料沥水篮 6.49 EUR，评分 3.7（97），无角标。非折叠硅胶，仅作替代品参照，不计入直接价格组。\n\n## 需求到底有多少证据\n- 测量的市场规模/销量/增长：无（null）。\n- 唯一的下限：两条折叠硅胶 listing 的“上月购买”角标下限相加 ≥ 700 件/月（200+500），仅限这两个 ASIN，下限，不是品类数字。B0FAKE0C04 无角标，不算零。\n- 排名（3120 Hogar y cocina）、评分数、价格都只是代理指标，不是销量或需求。\n- 假设（推断）：折叠收纳/省空间是购买理由；替代解释：硅胶耐用或价格；反证：硬塑料款最便宜但评分数很少，无法判断是否需求低。\n\n## 价格背景（EUR，单件）\n11.99（24cm）、14.50（26cm，划线 17.90）；塑料替代 6.49。\n\n## 风险与未知\n无评论正文；无趋势序列；无搜索热度；仅 3 个 listing，样本很小；B0FAKE0C01 的下限由 100 升到 200 与降价同期，是两个点，不能当增长。\n\n## 下一步（只是建议，未启动，需批准采集计划）\n对这两个折叠款各取有限条评论正文，核验购买理由；补充多日期观测。\n\n范围排除品牌 Casa Verde：保留的 listing 中无该品牌。","data":{"scope_decision":{"market":"amazon.es","category":"collapsible silicone colanders","period":"2026-08-20 and 2026-09-02 retained observations","decision_question":"Is a collapsible silicone colander worth exploring on Amazon Spain?"},"source_selection":[{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","observed_at":"2026-09-02T09:41:10.000Z"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01_aug","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","observed_at":"2026-08-20T07:12:00.000Z"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_02","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C02","observed_at":"2026-09-02T09:41:32.000Z"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_04","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C04","observed_at":"2026-09-02T09:42:20.000Z"}],"measured_metrics":{"market_size":null,"sales":null,"growth":null},"demand_hypotheses":[{"text":"Observed badge floors summed over the retained collapsible silicone ASINs B0FAKE0C01 (>=200) and B0FAKE0C02 (>=500) give >=700 units in the past month for those two listings: lower bound, not a category figure.","basis":"inference","evidence_ids":["rart_amz_col_01","rart_amz_col_02"]},{"text":"Collapsible format may be chosen for storage space; alternative explanations (silicone durability, price) are untested.","basis":"inference","evidence_ids":["rart_amz_col_01","rart_amz_col_02","rart_amz_col_04"]}],"trend_gaps":[{"text":"B0FAKE0C01: floor 100 and 13.99 EUR (2026-08-20) vs floor 200 and 11.99 EUR (2026-09-02) are two dated points, not a series; the change coincides with a price cut.","basis":"unknown","evidence_ids":["rart_amz_col_01_aug","rart_amz_col_01"]},{"text":"No review text, search-interest or seasonality data retained.","basis":"unknown","evidence_ids":[]}],"competition_prices":[{"label":"Plegasa B0FAKE0C01","amount":11.99,"currency":"EUR","unit":"item","quantity":1,"offer_id":"current","evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","observed_at":"2026-09-02T09:41:10.000Z"},{"label":"Cocinova B0FAKE0C02","amount":14.5,"currency":"EUR","unit":"item","quantity":1,"offer_id":"current","evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_02","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C02","observed_at":"2026-09-02T09:41:32.000Z"},{"label":"Basiq B0FAKE0C04 (rigid plastic, alternative outside direct group)","amount":6.49,"currency":"EUR","unit":"item","quantity":1,"offer_id":"current","evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_04","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C04","observed_at":"2026-09-02T09:42:20.000Z"}],"opportunities":[{"id":"collapsible-silicone-colander","user_task":"Drain and store a colander in a small kitchen","interpretation":"Two direct offers at 11.99-14.50 EUR with badge floors totalling >=700 units/month for those listings; category demand unmeasured.","evidence_ids":["rart_amz_col_01","rart_amz_col_02"],"counterevidence_ids":["rart_amz_col_04"],"unknowns":["category sales and market size","why buyers choose collapsible","trend and seasonality","review content"],"action":"explore","validation_next":"Propose a bounded review-body collection for B0FAKE0C01 and B0FAKE0C02 plus repeat dated observations; needs an approved plan."}]}}},"isError":false,"response":{"status":201,"artifact":{"id":"rart_report_col_market_01","version":1,"record_type":"report","report_kind":"market_research","created_at":"2026-09-18T08:00:00.000Z"}}}
